flowchart TD
    I[Controlled request intake] --> C{Classify request}
    C -->|Data subject| P[Privacy-rights procedure]
    C -->|Merchant or dispute| M[Contract, tenant authority and dispute procedure]
    C -->|Government, court or emergency| V[Authenticate requester and validate service]
    V --> L{Counsel: valid authority, jurisdiction, scope and notice?}
    L -->|Invalid or excessive| N[Reject, redirect, challenge or narrow]
    L -->|Valid| H[Scoped preservation or legal hold]
    H --> E[Authorized collection from named authoritative sources]
    E --> R[Review, minimize, redact, inventory and checksum]
    R --> A[Required legal/privacy/two-person approval]
    A --> D[Secure delivery and receipt evidence]
    D --> U[User notice now or calendared after restriction]
    U --> X[Release hold, dispose working copies and close case]

